鑒。諸王承謬，率眾見責，朝臣無正，各慮私困，收臣別省，送臣幽宮。臣不惜軀命，但念大晉衰微，枝黨欲盡，陛下孤危。若臣死國寧，亦家之利。但恐快凶人之志：無益于陛下耳。」","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","mentions":[{"id":"c-jinshu-059-yi:p007:m0116","start":0,"end":1,"surface":"乂","kind":"person","person_id":"4c6_984_9ed","status":"contextual_provisional","resolution_note":"本完整敘事單元與本段引語之具體角色；詳隨附逐錨審閱。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-059-yi:p007:m0117","start":4,"end":5,"surface":"穎","kind":"person","person_id":"e81_f09_000","status":"contextual_provisional","resolution_note":"本完整敘事單元與本段引語之具體角色；詳隨附逐錨審閱。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-059-yi:p007:m0118","start":40,"end":41,"surface":"乂","kind":"person","person_id":"4c6_984_9ed","status":"contextual_provisional","resolution_note":"本完整敘事單元與本段引語之具體角色；詳隨附逐錨審閱。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-059-yi:p007:m0119","start":42,"end":43,"surface":"上","kind":"person","person_id":"7e0_f69_1ac","status":"contextual_provisional","resolution_note":"本完整敘事單元與本段引語之具體角色；詳隨附逐錨審閱。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-059-yi:p007:m0120","start":50,"end":52,"surface":"張方","kind":"person","person_id":"eti_fp9_fq5","status":"contextual_provisional","resolution_note":"本完整敘事單元與本段引語之具體角色；詳隨附逐錨審閱。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-059-yi:p007:m0121","start":64,"end":68,"surface":"東海王越","kind":"person","person_id":"9o2_vhv_r7y","status":"contextual_provisional","resolution_note":"本完整敘事單元與本段引語之具體角色；詳隨附逐錨審閱。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-059-yi:p007:m0122","start":79,"end":80,"surface":"乂","kind":"person","person_id":"4c6_984_9ed","status":"contextual_provisional","resolution_note":"本完整敘事單元與本段引語之具體角色；詳隨附逐錨審閱。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-059-yi:p007:m0123","start":85,"end":86,"surface":"乂","kind":"person","person_id":"4c6_984_9ed","status":"contextual_provisional","resolution_note":"本完整敘事單元與本段引語之具體角色；詳隨附逐錨審閱。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-059-yi:p007:m0124","start":90,"end":92,"surface":"陛下","kind":"person","person_id":"7e0_f69_1ac","status":"contextual_provisional","resolution_note":"本完整敘事單元與本段引語之具體角色；詳隨附逐錨審閱。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-059-yi:p007:m0125","start":96,"end":97,"surface":"臣","kind":"person","